[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-advance 6...c5"]
[Name "Advance: 7.dxc5"]

7. dxc5 { Takes the pawn, but the pawn on d4 was what held up e5. }
7... Bxc5 { Takes back and develops at the same time. Now e5 is the weak pawn. [%csl Ye5] }
8. O-O Nc6 { Develops and hits e5. Black has an easy game: ...Nge7, castle, and ...Qc7 to win more squares. [%cal Gc6e5] } *
